  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Underground MV Electrical Network Gaza Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at construction of electrical network from ground cables to secure the power supply in the new regions in Gaza City.  This network will be constructed in Omar Al_Mokhtar, Al_Wihda and Al_Rasheed Streets.  This network will provide power supply to 500,000 citizens.</narrative>
  </description>
